Confetti is a 2006 British mockumentary romantic
comedy film released on 5 May 2006.

11
01:01:06,666 --> 01:01:12,666
It was conceived and directed by Debbie Isitt and stars many acclaimed British comedians, including Jessica
Stevenson, Jimmy Carr, Martin Freeman, Mark Heap, Julia Davis, Robert Webb and Olivia Colman.

12
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
It follows a bridal magazine competition for the most original wedding, the ultimate
prize being a house, and the three couples who are chosen to compete.

13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
The film follows the contestants in a fly-on-the-wall
documentary style, akin to The Office.

14
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
The script was entirely improvised.

15
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
The film was a box office success, grossing $4.9
million on a budget of $2 million.

16
